!README.md

# Secrets must never enter the image. The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so
# without these lines a developer's backend/.env — with live provider keys —
# is baked into every layer and travels with the image to anyone who pulls it.
# Keys reach a container through the platform's environment settings
# (render.yaml `sync: false`, `docker run -e`), never through the build.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/!.env.example
